l":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#pullrequestreview-2595928415","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102448","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#pullrequestreview-2595928415"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102448"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-05T14:20:52Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2596057798,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6avLLG","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Great catch! Unfortunately I think I missed even another key :sweat_smile: \r\n\r\nLooking at the keymap (which I should have done in the first place), it looks like we miss another one, `XKB_KEY_KP_Equal`.\r\n\r\nCould you please add this one too, while you're at it?\r\n\r\nFor reference, the keymap is as follows:\r\n\r\n`platform/linuxbsd/wayland/key_mapping_xkb.cpp`\r\n```cpp\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Equal] = Key::EQUAL;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Separator] = Key::COMMA;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Decimal] = Key::KP_PERIOD;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Multiply] = Key::KP_MULTIPLY;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Divide] = Key::KP_DIVIDE;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Subtract] = Key::KP_SUBTRACT;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Add] = Key::KP_ADD;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_0] = Key::KP_0;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_1] = Key::KP_1;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_2] = Key::KP_2;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_3] = Key::KP_3;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_4] = Key::KP_4;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_5] = Key::KP_5;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_6] = Key::KP_6;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_7] = Key::KP_7;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_8] = Key::KP_8;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_9] = Key::KP_9;\r\n// Same keys but with numlock off.\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Insert] = Key::INSERT;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Delete] = Key::KEY_DELETE;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_End] = Key::END;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Down] = Key::DOWN;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Page_Down] = Key::PAGEDOWN;\r\nxkb_keycode_map[XKB_KEY_KP_Left] = Key::LEFT;\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote that the \"numlock off\" keys do *not* need to be added as a switch case.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#pullrequestreview-2596057798","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102448","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#pullrequestreview-2596057798"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102448"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-05T15:00:30Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2596304000,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6awHSA","user":{"login":"deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas","html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Code looks good from my POV. Approving from my end.\r\n\r\nThat said I'd like to know if @bruvzg is convinced with the equal key situation before calling it done.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#pullrequestreview-2596304000","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102448","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102448#pullrequestreview-2596304000"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102448"}},"submitted_at":"2025-02-05T16:14:41Z","commit_id":"e34e1270621a69574b75ce4e392c28